@startuml
actor Tutor
participant "Tutors API" as API
database "SQL Server" as SQL
Tutor -> API: PUT /api/tutors/me/lessons/{lessonId}/note
API -> SQL: Find the tutor's lesson and its note
alt Owned lesson and valid fields
    API -> SQL: Insert or update the lesson note
    API --> Tutor: 204 No Content
else Missing or inaccessible lesson
    API --> Tutor: 404 Not Found
else Invalid fields
    API --> Tutor: 422 Unprocessable Entity
end
@enduml
